1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,330
W: I completely forgot that today is Rick's housewarming party.

2
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:08,470
I forgot to get him a gift, and I don't think I'll have enough time after work to go shopping.

3
00:00:09,090 --> 00:00:11,490
I'm going to run over to the mall during lunch.

4
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:12,770
Do you want to go together?

5
00:00:13,690 --> 00:00:16,660
M: Sorry, Jean, but I am meeting someone for lunch today.

6
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:19,575
Plus, I already picked up something a couple of nights ago.

7
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:20,770
W: I see.

8
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:23,710
I guess I have no choice but to go alone then.

9
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:27,250
Anyway, will you be taking your car to the party tonight?

10
00:00:27,595 --> 00:00:29,090
M: No, I'm getting a lift with Eric.

11
00:00:29,990 --> 00:00:33,930
My car conked out on me last night, and it is in the garage today.

12
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,810
I had to take the bus to work this morning.
